    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Frost Resistance.</strong> You have Resistance to Cold damage.</p><p><strong>Polar Strikes.</strong> When you hit a creature with a weapon, you can deal an extra 1d4 Cold damage to the target, which can take this extra damage only once per turn. This extra damage ignores Resistance to Cold damage. When you reach Ranger level 11, this extra damage increases to 1d6.</p>",
